{"id":"wb-7-1031","name":"舜王庙","retrievedAt":"2026-11-06T11:54:03+00:00","status":"ready","title":"舜王庙","text":"舜王庙位于浙江省绍兴市柯桥区王坛镇舜王山。相传舜受帝位后，避尧之子丹朱之乱于此，后人遂在此建庙纪念。现存建筑为清咸丰年间重修，清同治元年（1862年）重修。建筑面南向，占地面积1760平方米，由山门、戏台、大殿、后殿、东西厢房、外厢房组成。庙中戏台为重檐歇山顶，内置藻井。1997年8月29日，列入浙江省文物保护单位，2013年5月，列入第七批全国重点文物保护单位。","shortened":false,"sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E8%88%9C%E7%8E%8B%E5%BA%99","revisionId":91497718,"revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=91497718","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","authors":"维基百科贡献者","matchEvidence":"名称与地理坐标一致","image":{"path":"assets/wikipedia/6a951eb058f2e18e91b3cb24.jpg","title":"Emperor_Shun_Temple,_Shaoxing,_2023-06-22_03.jpg","sourceUrl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Emperor_Shun_Temple,_Shaoxing,_2023-06-22_03.jpg","originalUrl":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/5/5b/Emperor_Shun_Temple%2C_Shaoxing%2C_2023-06-22_03.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","author":"Siyuwj","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0","caption":"​绍兴柯桥舜王庙","width":320,"height":213}}